            "line": 499,
            "text": "theorem fourierSourceJet_eq_parameterJet (d : Direction) {f : State → ℂ}\n    (hf : ContDiff ℝ ∞ f) (hp : ParametricTorusInverse.Periodic f) (p : ℕ) :\n    fourierSourceJet d f p = parameterJet p (iterateInverse d p f)"
